12\nhttps://x.com/yudame_oekaki/status/1648018912595054593\n\n【氷狼鬼ニキ様のパーツ絵】\nhttps://x.com/Amagami_Nora/status/1486318371109220353\n\n【構図・ポーズ参考になりそうなイラスト】\nhttps://www.pixiv.net/artworks/130968509\nhttps://www.pixiv.net/artworks/130829600\n\n以上、どうぞよろしくお願いいたします。", "nc": 145, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@Shinagi_Tama/works/12", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 475651, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/bbfd6667/uploads/origins/ca176887-15fb-4309-ab16-979eb70432e9?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=ac8b12139b3bcefb48f2f4c9d5fd67c5", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/bbfd6667/uploads/origins/ca176887-15fb-4309-ab16-979eb70432e9?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=ac8b12139b3bcefb48f2f4c9d5fd67c5, https://si.imgix.net/bbfd6667/uploads/origins/ca176887-15fb-4309-ab16-979eb70432e9?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=59ff8099c87a127bd706f84cd91884a8 2x, https://si.imgix.net/bbfd6667/uploads/origins/ca176887-15fb-4309-ab16-979eb70432e9?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=8963a33b9bb4a90045b8c7fad2d36d1a 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/bbfd6667/uploads/origins/ca176887-15fb-4309-ab16-979eb70432e9?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=bd6573b2efe15d2cb3bfe79067dd5d53", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/bbfd6667/uploads/origins/ca176887-15fb-4309-ab16-979eb70432e9?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=bd6573b2efe15d2cb3bfe79067dd5d53, https://si.imgix.net/bbfd6667/uploads/origins/ca176887-15fb-4309-ab16-979eb70432e9?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=20